        "Description": "Agent 47, you are assigned in a new FTL: Faster Than Light mission. Eliminate the guards on the path to the villa, infiltrate it by any means necessary, and take down the duo of Alma Reynard and Gerard Mann, who lead a powerful private militia. Be as vigilant and discreet as possible. Their soldiers are everywhere, even hidden in the most unexpected places.\r\rDon&apos;t forget: the slightest misstep could be fatal... Be careful and good luck.",
